/-- Literal original-radical application: the actual edge mover has index four
in the restricted original Sylow, and the strict paired comparison produces an
overlapping backward critical path. The paired residual generation and the
membership of the same transporter remain explicit source-selection premises. -/
theorem original_radical_paired_backward_knownSimple
    (hb : 4 < replacementDistance h d)
    {z c : Vertex d.radical}
    (p : CriticalPath d.radical (replacementGeometry h d) (alpha d.radical) z)
    (hsmall : (Q d.radical z).relIndex (Z d.radical (alpha d.radical)) < 4)
    (hct : Adjacent d.radical c (beta d.radical))
    (hequal : edgeMover (d := d) c (beta d.radical) =
